        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jisu tei lung geina tat the,",
            "Haumuh mei rui zaina;",
            "Tatnipui chaeng tei zaulana,",
            "Theilounipui bam thang.",
            "",
            "Luangbut thang tei thaengc thau kan the,",
            "Siangc loupui thingru khou,",
            "Rianra ‘kheangmei khuan chumei tei,",
            "Kanloumei pu khuan e.",
            "",
            "2. Ryanramei Kros tei puan lana,",
            "Poubaomei ta zaina,",
            "Tabui thang tei thaengc thau nicho?",
            "Ai rui phangzau bamni.",
            "",
            "3. Charinmei sauh pirun runlou,",
            "Haumuh mei rui zaina,",
            "Theinipui luangbut thang tat the,",
            "Apap guai tei phungna.",
            "",
            "4. Khou tei mei geicmei kariuna,",
            "Ravguangc haumuh mei guai,",
            "Kaniu ningmei guangc tangh khang e",
            "Kros khou thaeng thaumei tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
